WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
Episode 94

2
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.140
You are using

3
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.020
my relationship with the Bradley family to make
money.

4
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.140
You really disgust me.

5
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.020
Who's speaking?

6
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:09.460
You?

7
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.580
Why are you here?

8
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.420
Where do you think I should be?

9
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:13.940
At the hospital?

10
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.200
Oliver,

11
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.260
you pushed me down the stairs

12
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.580
and used my medical expenses

13
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.660
to threaten my daughter.

14
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.300
How could you

15
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.260
be so heartless?

16
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.300
How dare you say that about me,

17
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.100
you wicked woman!

18
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.260
What did you do, huh?

19
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.500
You betrayed

20
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.140
and cuckolded me.

21
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.700
I didn't make you pay for that.

22
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.220
I just

23
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.540
made you unconscious for two years.

24
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.580
You should

25
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.940
be grateful to me.

26
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.740
You're spouting nonsense.

27
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.860
I never

28
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.700
cheated on you.

29
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.580
Even now,

30
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.220
you're still blaming me for everything.

31
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.820
My mother has never

32
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.240
cheated on you.

33
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.860
It's all lies made up by Marcella.

34
00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.100
She has already confessed.

35
00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:49.980
She deliberately

36
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.140
fabricated these things.

37
00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:51.980
You have never

38
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.660
believed in my mother.

39
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.300
You only believe

40
00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.340
Marcella's words.

41
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.900
That's impossible.

42
00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.660
Your mother

43
00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.460
was indifferent to me back then.

44
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.380
She always went out

45
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.260
for no reason.

46
00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.940
She must be seeing someone.

47
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.580
If I didn't go out,

48
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.940
where would the Curtis Group get its business from?

49
00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.180
Enough.

50
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:07.860
He simply could not bring himself

51
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:08.580
to believe the truth.

52
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.540
It's useless to explain to him.

53
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.340
Let's go.

54
00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.780
Wait, wait!

55
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.340
It's all the fault of that rebellious daughter

56
00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:14.940
who lied to me.

57
00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.020
Rhonda, for our old time's sake...

58
00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:17.700
Enough.

59
00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.140
What's the point of

60
00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:19.860
saying all this now?

61
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.180
Oliver,

62
00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.700
I want to divorce you

63
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.740
and I will sue you for

64
00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:25.940
attempted murder against me two years ago.

65
00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.360
Do you really have to go this far?
